<main class="patchbay-shell patchbay-board" id="patchbay-stuck">
  <.board_header title="Stuck on a site">
    <:crumbs>PATCHBAY / HELP</:crumbs>
  </.board_header>

  <article class="pb-sheet-section patchbay-board-card pb-setup-page">
    <section>
      <p>
        That site address {@problem}. Give the site as it appears in the address bar, for example <code>/help?site=example.com&amp;goal=add a jacket to my cart&amp;error=the add_to_cart tool timed out</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</main>
